  "sources": [
    "September 8 2025 npm supply-chain worm following the compromise of the qix maintainer account. Malicious versions of chalk, debug, ansi-styles, strip-ansi, supports-color and more than a dozen related packages were published between 13:12 and 13:20 UTC. Compromised version numbers and publish times were read from the live npm registry time map on 2026-08-19, where they survive although the versions were removed. The window end is an estimate of the remediation window and is flagged as such."
